                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15a3/728: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Castle</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-03T13:00:00-05:00">March 3, 1930—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. 1 have repeated your 35 to London as I do not know the answer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
